    {
      "id": "claim_76f6ae52e8a641318ad2e3ff8a2c5e63",
      "statement": "Tokenizer loading is a soft failure boundary: `build_training_data` catches any tokenizer-loading exception, preserves the real cached ids, prints an explicit warning, and substitutes `_SyntheticTokenizerStub`, whose byte-level generation behavior is not semantically equivalent to the intended tokenizer.",
