    {
      "id": "claim_8d28450deb9e4153aeebc42911a39a8e",
      "statement": "The trainer constructs the configured decoder Transformer, passes gradient-checkpointing, QK-Norm, and implementation settings into it, and moves it to the selected device; during training, decoder layers use activation checkpointing while evaluation and generation use the ordinary decoder path.",
