      "statement": "Periodic logging runs after compute and optimizer work, synchronizes CUDA before reading timing, logs loss, learning rate, gradient norm, throughput, token counts, effective batch size, data wait, and CUDA memory/utilization metrics when applicable, and mirrors key values in the tqdm postfix.",
