      "id": "claim_c187b484609142f9b6dac0a3a693b76a",
      "statement": "Validation evaluates the EMA model when enabled, otherwise the live model; it uses at most `val_max_batches`, CUDA-only BF16 autocast, hidden-state chunked loss, per-batch averaging, capped-exponent perplexity, W&B logging, and restores training mode. A strictly improved loss synchronously saves the live model weights to the best-model path, even when validation used EMA.",
