    {
      "id": "claim_9d23764864db4e669abc1e886bee7314",
      "statement": "Periodic checkpoints contain model, optimizer, scheduler, step/token metadata, best validation loss, Python/NumPy/Torch RNG states, optional CUDA RNG state, configuration, and optional EMA state; asynchronous saves run `torch.save` in a daemon thread and return that thread, while retention deletes older numeric step files beyond `keep_last_n_checkpoints`.",
